# 🌐 API & Backend Rules

## API Contracts
- Always define/update API contracts (`openapi.yaml` or `tRPC contracts`) when backend interfaces change.

## Error Handling
- Always return typed errors with helpful messages for consumers.
- Include enough context for debugging
- Use consistent error formats

## Caching
- Prefer SWR/react-query or server-side caching for expensive queries.
- Implement appropriate cache invalidation strategies
